# Brand colors

Mmondo Adventures uses primary `#ff7900`, secondary `#9f4200`, black, and white. Do not introduce default Bootstrap/browser blue (`#0d6efd`, `#0a58ca`, `#003087`) for links, buttons, focus rings, hover, or active states.

| Token | Hex | Tailwind |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Primary | `#ff7900` | `primary` |
| Secondary | `#9f4200` | `brand-secondary` / `primary-container` |
| Charcoal | `#1E1E1E` | `charcoal` |
| White | `#ffffff` | `white` |

Rules:

- Filled buttons, links, icons, and focus rings use primary `#ff7900`.
- Hover and active states use secondary `#9f4200`. Pressed can be charcoal.
- Keep `--bs-primary` and `--bs-link-color` on `#ff7900`, `--bs-link-hover-color` on `#9f4200`.
- Do not use Tailwind `secondary` (`#5f5e5e`) as a brand accent; that token is muted gray text only.
- Do not override brand tokens with blue, purple, or other accent palettes.
